<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys Exports in bonus announcement.</title>
<headline>Hayleys Exports in bonus announcement.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayleys Exports Ltd announced a bonus issue of one new share for every six held, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The firm, a subsidiary of blue chip Hayleys Ltd, processes and trades in coir fibre and coir fibre products.</p>
<p>The share was last traded at 54 rupees a 10-rupee share on May 9.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
